The second edition of the Addis Bamboo Bazaar, co-organized by Addis Bamboo and ETT Coffee by Darco, will take place on Saturday, 8 August , and Sunday, 9 August . Scheduled from 10:00 AM to 6:00 PM at ETT Coffee by Darco.

​The bazaar features displays of bamboo craftsmanship, handmade goods, visual art, and home décor. In addition to the artisan exhibits, attendees can experience single-origin Ethiopian coffee tastings and traditional coffee ceremonies.

